  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7211901",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "721190101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "721190101": {
            "id": "721190101",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Oh! Uh, Traveler... Things do not look good.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190102"
            ]
          },
          "721190102": {
            "id": "721190102",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "The Fatui within have concentrated their forces near the core. It seems that they have discovered something.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190103"
            ]
          },
          "721190103": {
            "id": "721190103",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Surely they don't intend to breach the core's defenses... No, we can no longer afford to delay. We must move now to initiate functionality tests.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190104"
            ]
          },
          "721190104": {
            "id": "721190104",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Functionality tests?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190105"
            ]
          },
          "721190105": {
            "id": "721190105",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "By that, I mean that we must test our machine friend's purification abilities. I have no intention of moving it into the furnace only to find that it will not function.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190106"
            ]
          },
          "721190106": {
            "id": "721190106",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "To that end, please help me find 3 Onikabuto, if you will.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190107"
            ]
          },
          "721190107": {
            "id": "721190107",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "I want to place them near the Mikage Furnace, which will cause them to be tainted by Tatarigami.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190108"
            ]
          },
          "721190108": {
            "id": "721190108",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Then, we will retrieve them, and use this purification device to cleanse them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190109"
            ]
          },
          "721190109": {
            "id": "721190109",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "This is the test I have devised.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190110"
            ]
          },
          "721190110": {
            "id": "721190110",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Where do I find these Onikabuto?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190111"
            ]
          },
          "721190111": {
            "id": "721190111",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Hmm... normally, they are found in Electro-rich environments...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190112"
            ]
          },
          "721190112": {
            "id": "721190112",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "I have also heard that they can survive near the Mikage Furnace. What hardy little critters they are...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190113"
            ]
          },
          "721190113": {
            "id": "721190113",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why don't I just snag some from in the furnace, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190114"
            ]
          },
          "721190114": {
            "id": "721190114",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Well, you could do that, but if you were to take Onikabuto directly from the Mikage Furnace for testing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190115"
            ]
          },
          "721190115": {
            "id": "721190115",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "To tell you the truth, I worry about the reliability of my little machine...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190116"
            ]
          },
          "721190116": {
            "id": "721190116",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "It is best to work through tests step by step, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190117"
            ]
          },
          "721190117": {
            "id": "721190117",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Ahem, well then... please help me find 3 Onikabuto, if you will.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190119",
              "721190121"
            ]
          },
          "721190119": {
            "id": "721190119",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "So you do. Just 3 is fine!"
          },
          "721190121": {
            "id": "721190121",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Well... you could use yourself as the test subject, yes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190122"
            ]
          },
          "721190122": {
            "id": "721190122",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "But like I said before, this device's reliability may not meet expectations.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190123"
            ]
          },
          "721190123": {
            "id": "721190123",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "If something unexpected truly does happen during the purification process, you might... uh, encounter some unforeseen issues...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190124"
            ]
          },
          "721190124": {
            "id": "721190124",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Ahem. Let's just stick to using the Onikabuto for now, shall we?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "721190125"
            ]
          },
          "721190125": {
            "id": "721190125",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Just 3 will do! Once you've caught them, just bring them back here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
